                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is immensely bland. I understand it is in early access, however to buy it now would be a mistake. One city map for every city, no diverse or different robot troops, two different weapons that make no difference to your damage, bland fights that leave you unsatisfied and bored, gunplay is terrible hence there is no recoil, no ammo, literally just you pointing a gun at an enemy and holding down left click. No tutorial or control options either, so good luck finding the controls yourself. Great concept, badly played.",
